  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jumuiya Women Fund was established to respond to the resourcing challenges faced by women in local Kenyan communities living and working within the women&apos;s movement. Jumuiya Women Fund works on thematic issues such as violence against women and girls, sexual and reproductive health and rights, economic rights, and access to education, and supports women affected or displaced by conflict, women with disabilities, women with diverse sexual orientation and gender identities, and young and elderly women.</narrative>
